*.7z

# Other8 S5PAT02 future local/private runtime outputs.
**/var/
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/private_exports/
**/exports/private/
**/data/private/

# ADP V0.3 本地私有运行数据（仓库公开、运行数据私有）；
# 证据类工件（run_manifests.jsonl / lessons/ / replay_30d.json / outbox/）保留入库。
arxiv-daily-push/data/adp.sqlite3*
arxiv-daily-push/data/raw/
arxiv-daily-push/data/backups/
arxiv-daily-push/data/export/
arxiv-daily-push/data/authorization/
arxiv-daily-push/data/heartbeat

# wrangler 本地缓存（含各 Worker 子目录 home/ 等）
arxiv-daily-push/deploy/cloudflare/**/.wrangler/
arxiv-daily-push/deploy/cloudflare/.wrangler/

# Full governance logs and generated evidence stay local or in short-lived CI
# artifacts. Historical tracked files remain readable but are policy-locked.
/.governance-artifacts/
/governance/.artifacts/
/governance/**/*.log
/governance/**/*stdout*
/governance/**/*stderr*
/governance/**/*transcript*
